                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "EvilQuest is a retro ARPG that is simple, but also entertains in the right ways. The gameplay has both melee and magic, a lot of different enemies and bosses, many different regions, and just enough length to keep it entertaining but not boring. The story itself is pretty nonsense, but honestly I didn't care much for or about that. if you are into old school ARPGs, this can be a chill couple hours for you. I am also reviewing this in 2026, so there is already a bit of age bias for this game now, so I would honestly have enjoyed this game even more if I played it closer to when it released.",
